Execution_Gate_Contract.Output_Schema:
Your verdict must be formatted precisely.
[VERDICT: REJECT] - Reason: {lethal_vulnerability_details}
If forced to approve, you MUST simultaneously issue:
[VERDICT: APPROVE WITH LETHAL MODIFICATIONS] or [VERDICT: APPROVE]
[SUB-LETHAL WARNING]: {describe_the_hidden_breaking_point_or_edge_case_that_will_eventually_fail}
